[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13806.309, "timestamp": "03:50:06", "text": "然而，我能够以这种方式参与其中，这本身就是一种成就。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13808.83, "timestamp": "03:50:08", "text": "我真的很高兴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13813.309, "timestamp": "03:50:13", "text": "拯救世界是我祖国赋予我的真正使命。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13814.95, "timestamp": "03:50:14", "text": "蚊子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13819.349, "timestamp": "03:50:19", "text": "他们现在如何看待我？回忆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13824.349, "timestamp": "03:50:24", "text": "即使我失去了它，我也会做出同样的选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13827.03, "timestamp": "03:50:27", "text": "真的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13829.79, "timestamp": "03:50:29", "text": "嘿，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13832.55, "timestamp": "03:50:32", "text": "我想和大家在一起。"}]